- id: P:program/collect-the-offers
  type: program
  name: collect-the-offers
  summary: Count what the house sells, each offer kept once it is marked as the house says it; a loop that collects,
    with a binding and a choice of its own on every pass.
  why: count what the house sells, each offer kept once it is marked as the house says it; a loop that collects,
    with a binding and a choice of its own on every pass.
  must: []
  decided: []
  takes:
  - name: h
    type: volume
  gives:
